---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Affiliate Disclosure - ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="StackVerdict affiliate partnership disclosure and monetization policy." />
		<style is:global>
			body {
				background-color: #0b0f17 !important;
				color: #cbd5e1 !important;
			}
		</style>
		<style>
			main {
				max-width: 800px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 3em 1em;
			}
			.policy-card {
				background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.8);
				backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
				border-radius: 16px;
				padding: 2.5em;
				box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
			}
			h1 {
				font-size: 2.2em;
				color: #f8fafc;
				margin-top: 0;
				margin-bottom: 0.2em;
			}
			.subtitle {
				color: #94a3b8;
				font-size: 0.95em;
				margin-bottom: 2em;
				border-bottom: 1px solid #1e293b;
				padding-bottom: 1em;
			}
			h2 {
				color: #60a5fa;
				font-size: 1.3em;
				margin-top: 1.5em;
			}
			p, li {
				line-height: 1.7;
				color: #cbd5e1;
				font-size: 1em;
			}
			.highlight-box {
				background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.1);
				border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
				padding: 1.2em 1.5em;
				border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
				margin: 1.5em 0;
			}
			.highlight-box p {
				margin: 0;
				color: #93c5fd;
				font-weight: 500;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<div class="policy-card">
				<h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
				<div class="subtitle">Last updated: August 2026</div>

				<div class="highlight-box">
					<p>💡 TL;DR: We may earn a commission when you purchase tools through our links. This never impacts our ratings or increases your cost.</p>
				</div>

				<h2>Transparency First</h2>
				<p>
					At <strong>StackVerdict</strong>, independence and reader trust are our top priorities. To keep our benchmarks, in-depth code testing, and reviews completely free to read, we participate in various affiliate marketing programs.
				</p>

				<h2>How Affiliate Links Work</h2>
				<p>
					Some of the outbound links on this website (such as links to Cursor, GitHub Copilot, JetBrains, hosting providers, or SaaS platforms) are affiliate links. 
					If you click on one of these links and sign up or purchase a paid subscription, StackVerdict may receive a financial referral fee or commission.
				</p>

				<h2>Editorial Independence Guarantee</h2>
				<p>
					Our monetization model strictly follows these core rules:
				</p>
				<ul>
					<li><strong>No Paid Reviews:</strong> Software vendors cannot pay us for a higher score or a favorable review.</li>
					<li><strong>Objective Benchmarks:</strong> All tool ratings are based on measurable criteria like latency, accuracy, and price-to-performance ratio.</li>
					<li><strong>Same Price for You:</strong> Using our affiliate links never incurs any extra cost to you. In many cases, our partnerships provide exclusive discounts or extended trial periods.</li>
				</ul>

				<h2>Questions?</h2>
				<p>
					If you have any questions regarding our affiliate relationships or review methodology, feel free to reach out via our contact channels.
				</p>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>